# VVDN - Cap tau bay hang canh lien tiep RWY35L, khoang cach toi thieu
# tinh trong VVDN_KhoangCachToiThieu_TiepCanLienTiep.docx. Nhieu loai tau
# bay THAT (ty le HEAVY ~30%), thoat ly NGAU NHIEN G4->gate 28 / G6->san
# do so 11, + 3 tinh huong tau DI SAU phai bay lai vao vong cho THAT
# Holding KONGA (phuong thuc bay lai that RWY35L) do thieu phan cach nhieu dong.
00:00:00.000>DTMULT 1
00:00:00.000>PLUGINS LOAD SURFACETAXI

